  "notes": "Jacobsen et al. (2005) report the high-pressure distorted phase on an equivalent hexagonal cell basis. The extrapolated V0=59.72 A^3 corresponds to the paper's molar volume 11.99 cm^3/mol only for Z=3, establishing the represented cell basis. The source does not assign a space group or publish an ambient lattice metric for this high-pressure phase, so neither is inferred here.",
